#!args --verify-dirty
# the Aufgabe panel (workspace/task.rs) with the lab of the load balancer
# (assets/labs/02-lastverteilung.jfnet): the empty panel and the list of labs (Datei › Labor
# öffnen …), the lab's title, introduction and goals in order, "Prüfen" with what the checks
# found, hints one by one, the progress; the lab solved in the window: WEB3 cabled with the
# Verbinden tool, LB1's backends in its device window (Dienste › Einstellungen …: text that is
# no JSON, refused with its line and column, a setting the simulator refuses, then the third
# backend), every goal reached; undo keeps them reached, "Simulation zurücksetzen" starts them
# over.  Ids: 49153 "Prüfen", 49157 the introduction, 49168 + i the goals, 49408 + i their hint
# buttons, 50193 + i the rows of the list of labs, 26624 the first device window, 51200 the
# settings button of its first service, 51456 the settings editor, 51472 Übernehmen.
size 1280 800
theme light
# ---- without a lab the panel leads to the list
cmd 301
expect text:"Keine Aufgabe" exists
click button:"Labor öffnen …"
expect dialog:"Labor öffnen" exists
expect text:"Campus: ein VLAN für die Studierenden" exists
expect text:"5 Ziele · Zwei Webserver schaffen die Last nicht: WEB3 anschließen und in den Loadbalancer aufnehmen." exists
expect text:"Geshardeter Speicher: ein Knoten fällt aus" exists
expect text:"Ein Cache vor dem langsamen Katalog" exists
expect #50193 selected
click text:"Lastverteilung: der dritte Webserver"
expect #50194 selected
click button:"Öffnen"
expect dialog:"Labor öffnen" missing
# ---- the lab: its title, the introduction, the goals in order
expect text:"Verteilte Systeme · 5 Ziele" exists
expect text:"0 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
expect #49157 open
expect #49168 unchecked
expect #49172 unchecked
expect text:"1. WEB3 hängt am Servernetz" exists
expect text:"5. Keine Fehler mehr" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/task_intro.png
# the introduction folds away (the goals and their hints have the room then)
click #49157
expect #49168 exists
shot build/jfnetworker/task_folded.png
# ---- two web servers at their limit; "Prüfen" says what the first goal lacks
wait 6000
click button:"Prüfen"
expect text:"WEB3 route 10.0.2.0/24 via connected: keine Route" exists
# the first goal's hint, then the task's
click #49408
expect text:"Werkzeug Verbinden (C): von WEB3 auf SW2 ziehen. Mit Umschalt beim Loslassen verbindet es sofort über die besten Ports." exists
expect #49408 missing
click button:"Hinweis zeigen (1 von 2)"
expect text:"lbctl in der Konsole von LB1 zeigt jedes Backend mit Zustand, Anfragen und Fehlern." exists
expect button:"Hinweis zeigen (2 von 2)" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/task_checked.png
# ---- WEB3 cabled (Verbinden, Shift: at once): the first goal; the second says what it found
key c
drag listitem:"WEB3" listitem:"SW2" 8 shift
key v
wait 2000
expect #49168 checked
expect text:"1 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
expect text:"LB1 svc lb metric backends_up == 3: gemessen: 2" exists
# ---- LB1's backends: its device window, Dienste › Einstellungen …
dblclick listitem:"LB1" shift
expect window 26624 open
click tab:"Dienste"
click #51200
expect text:"Die Einstellungen von lb als JSON. Übernehmen prüft sie und startet LB1 mit ihnen neu." exists
# no JSON: refused with its line and column
focus #51456
key ctrl+a
type "{\"mode\": \"http\", backends}"
click #51472
expect text:"Zeile 1, Spalte 18: kein gültiges JSON (expected_string)." exists
# a setting the simulator refuses
focus #51456
key ctrl+a
type "{\"mode\": \"udp\", \"backends\": []}"
click #51472
expect text:"Dienst lb: „mode“ kennt udp nicht (http, tcp)." exists
shot build/jfnetworker/task_settings_refused.png window 26624
# the third backend
focus #51456
key ctrl+a
type "{\"mode\": \"http\", \"port\": 80, \"backends\": [{\"name\": \"web1\", \"addr\": \"10.0.2.11\"}, {\"name\": \"web2\", \"addr\": \"10.0.2.12\"}, "
type "{\"name\": \"web3\", \"addr\": \"10.0.2.13\"}], \"health\": {\"type\": \"http\", \"path\": \"/health\", \"interval_ms\": 1000}}"
click #51472
expect #51456 missing
expect button:"Einstellungen …" exists
close window 26624
# ---- the goals follow, in order
wait 20000
expect #49169 checked
expect #49170 checked
expect #49171 checked
expect #49172 checked
expect text:"5 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
expect text:"Geschafft: alle Ziele erreicht." exists
# "Prüfen" after the fix: nothing is missing any more
click button:"Prüfen"
expect text:"LB1 svc lb metric backends_up == 3: gemessen: 2" missing
expect text:"5 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/task_done.png
# ---- undo: LB1 has two backends again, the goals stay reached
key ctrl+z
wait 1000
expect text:"5 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
# ---- Simulation zurücksetzen: a fresh engine, the goals start over (the cable is still there)
cmd 55
wait 3000
expect text:"1 von 5 Zielen erreicht" exists
expect #49169 unchecked
expect_nowarn
